# TOEFL Vocabulary Day54

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| distinct | 뚜렷이 다른 | The two species have distinct characteristics. |
| accumulate | 축적되다, 축적하다 | Snow accumulated on the ground. |
| undergo | 겪다 | The region underwent major changes. |
| trigger | 촉발하다 | The event triggered a series of reactions. |
| regulate | 조절하다, 규제하다 | The body regulates its temperature. |
| interact | 상호작용하다 | Animals interact with their environment. |
| stable | 안정적인 | The ecosystem remained stable. |
| eventually | 결국 | The species eventually adapted to the environment. |

### 암기 포인트
- distinct characteristics: 뚜렷한 특징
- accumulate over time: 시간이 지나며 축적되다
- undergo changes: 변화를 겪다
- trigger a reaction: 반응을 촉발하다
- regulate temperature: 온도를 조절하다
- interact with: ~와 상호작용하다
